{"seq":2,"slug":"quota-license-certificate-manage","title":"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/quota-license-certificate-manage","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用\">配额证与许可证件的管理与占用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在先来先得（FCFS）之外，多数 TRQ 采用<strong>证件管理</strong>：进口商或出口商先向主管部门申请一份配额证/许可证（quota certificate / import licence），取得后报关时凭证明示，额度从证件上扣减。这引入了一个 FCFS 模型里不存在的中间态——<strong>额度已经被分配出去，但还没有被报关消耗</strong>。不理解这个中间态，就会出现&quot;证件已发、额度未见消耗、系统以为还有余额&quot;的经典超发。</p>\n<p>配额的管理方式是官方配额数据里的<strong>显式字段</strong>而非隐含属性。欧盟 TARIC 配额查询把每个配额按&quot;管理方式&quot;（如先来先得、进口许可证、同时审查、历史分配）标注，并给出&quot;关键&quot;（critical）与&quot;状态&quot;两个独立筛选维度——状态取值包括 Blocked / Exhausted / Not blocked / Not exhausted。见 <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/taric/quota_consultation.jsp\">EU TARIC 配额查询</a>。这意味着&quot;证件管理&quot;不是系统可选的设计，而是被外部规则强加的分类：管理方式决定了额度在先分配还是后扣减。</p>\n<p>证件管理把额度生命周期从两态（可用/已用）拉长为四态：<strong>申请中 → 已分配（有效期内） → 已占用（报关扣减） → 已释放或已过期</strong>。工程上必须为每一态建立独立字段与可查询状态，而不是用一个 <code>balance</code> 数字含糊表达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[额度池: quota_total_qty] --&gt; B[申请 Application]&#10;    B --&gt; C{主管机关审查}&#10;    C --&gt;|批准| D[已分配 allocated_qty&lt;br/&gt;证件签发, 有有效期]&#10;    C --&gt;|拒绝| E[申请关闭]&#10;    D --&gt; F{报关使用}&#10;    F --&gt;|报关受理| G[已占用 consumed_qty]&#10;    F --&gt;|到期未用| H[过期失效, 归还额度池]&#10;    D --&gt;|持有人放弃| I[主动释放, 归还额度池]&#10;    G --&gt; J[核销/存档]&#10;    H --&gt; A&#10;    I --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[额度池: quota_total_qty] --&gt; B[申请 Application]\n    B --&gt; C{主管机关审查}\n    C --&gt;|批准| D[已分配 allocated_qty&lt;br/&gt;证件签发, 有有效期]\n    C --&gt;|拒绝| E[申请关闭]\n    D --&gt; F{报关使用}\n    F --&gt;|报关受理| G[已占用 consumed_qty]\n    F --&gt;|到期未用| H[过期失效, 归还额度池]\n    D --&gt;|持有人放弃| I[主动释放, 归还额度池]\n    G --&gt; J[核销/存档]\n    H --&gt; A\n    I --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>字段载体</th>\n<th>是否可再分配</th>\n<th>是否已计入总量</th>\n<th>典型风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请中</td>\n<td>application</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>重复申请占位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已分配合格</td>\n<td>allocated_qty</td>\n<td>否（已锁定）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>到期未用变成死额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已占用</td>\n<td>consumed_qty</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>报关与证件未一一对应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已过期/释放</td>\n<td>释放事件</td>\n<td>是（归还池）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>归还延迟导致池长期偏小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已核销</td>\n<td>archive</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>审计链断裂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"证件的数据模型-双量分离\">证件的数据模型：双量分离</h2><h3 id=\"三量分离的数据模型\">三量分离的数据模型</h3><p>证件管理的核心设计是<strong>分配量与实际耗用量分离</strong>。这与 FCFS 模型只记一个 <code>consumed_qty</code> 是本质区别。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE quota_certificate (&#10;  certificate_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  quota_order_number TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES tariff_rate_quota(quota_order_number),&#10;  holder_id          TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 配额持有人（进口商/出口商）&#10;  origin_country     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  issued_qty         NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL, -- 签发量&#10;  consumed_qty       NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  reserved_qty       NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- 已锁定待报关&#10;  quota_unit         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  issued_on          DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_from         DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to           DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  status             TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (status IN&#10;                       (&#39;ISSUED&#39;,&#39;PARTIALLY_USED&#39;,&#39;FULLY_USED&#39;,&#39;EXPIRED&#39;,&#39;REVOKED&#39;,&#39;RELEASED&#39;)),&#10;  issuing_authority  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  CHECK (consumed_qty + reserved_qty &lt;= issued_qty)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE certificate_usage (&#10;  usage_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  certificate_id TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES quota_certificate(certificate_id),&#10;  entry_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  qty_used       NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  used_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (certificate_id, entry_id)          -- 同一报关不可重复占用同一证件&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quota_certificate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tariff_rate_quota(quota_order_number),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  holder_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 配额持有人（进口商/出口商）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_country     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_qty         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 签发量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumed_qty       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reserved_qty       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已锁定待报关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quota_unit         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_on          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                       (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ISSUED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIALLY_USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FULLY_USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REVOKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issuing_authority  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (consumed_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> issued_qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> certificate_usage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usage_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_certificate(certificate_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_used       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  used_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (certificate_id, entry_id)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同一报关不可重复占用同一证件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段 <code>issued_qty / reserved_qty / consumed_qty</code> 各司其职：<code>issued_qty</code> 是签发上限，<code>reserved_qty</code> 表达&quot;下单已锁定、尚未报关&quot;，<code>consumed_qty</code> 表达&quot;报关已完成&quot;。<code>CHECK</code> 约束把不变式写进数据库，避免应用层漏判。<code>certificate_usage</code> 上的唯一约束用于防重复占用——这是审计中最常被查的问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可用证件额度\">可用证件额度</h3><p>报关时的可用量不是 <code>issued_qty - consumed_qty</code>，而是再减去已锁定部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"available(cert) = cert.issued_qty - cert.consumed_qty - cert.reserved_qty&#10;&#10;报关受理时:&#10;  if qty &lt;= available(cert):&#10;      cert.consumed_qty += qty&#10;      if cert.reserved_qty &gt;= qty: cert.reserved_qty -= qty&#10;      # 状态推进&#10;      new_status = (consumed_qty + reserved_qty == issued_qty) ? &#39;FULLY_USED&#39; : &#39;PARTIALLY_USED&#39;&#10;  else:&#10;      超额部分按配额外税率计税（见 TRQ 两档税率）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>available(cert) = cert.issued_qty - cert.consumed_qty - cert.reserved_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>报关受理时:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if qty &#x3C;= available(cert):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cert.consumed_qty += qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if cert.reserved_qty >= qty: cert.reserved_qty -= qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      # 状态推进</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      new_status = (consumed_qty + reserved_qty == issued_qty) ? 'FULLY_USED' : 'PARTIALLY_USED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      超额部分按配额外税率计税（见 TRQ 两档税率）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条 <code>available</code> 公式是把&quot;下单占用&quot;（reserved）与&quot;报关消耗&quot;（consumed）分开的直接收益：没有 reserved 概念的系统，在下单到报关的窗口里会把同一份额度许给两次采购。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证件与报关的绑定时序\">证件与报关的绑定时序</h2><h3 id=\"三类时间错配与适用性判定\">三类时间错配与适用性判定</h3><p>证件管理引入了一条 FCFS 不存在的时序约束：<strong>证件有效性与报关日期的相对关系</strong>。三类常见错配：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>报关日早于证件生效日</strong>：证件签发有生效起点，早于此日的报关不能凭此证件享配额内税率。</li>\n<li><strong>报关日晚于证件到期日</strong>：证件过期后即使额度未用完也不得使用；过期额度应归还额度池供再分配。</li>\n<li><strong>跨配额期使用</strong>：配额按期间（period）划分，上一期的证件不能用于新一期的报关。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 证件适用性判定：三个时间条件必须同时满足&#10;SELECT c.certificate_id&#10;FROM quota_certificate c&#10;WHERE c.holder_id = $holder&#10;  AND c.quota_order_number = $quota&#10;  AND c.status IN (&#39;ISSUED&#39;,&#39;PARTIALLY_USED&#39;)&#10;  AND $entry_date BETWEEN c.valid_from AND c.valid_to       -- 条件 2/3&#10;  AND $entry_date BETWEEN (SELECT quota_period_start FROM tariff_rate_quota&#10;                            WHERE quota_order_number = $quota)&#10;                       AND (SELECT quota_period_end FROM tariff_rate_quota&#10;                            WHERE quota_order_number = $quota)&#10;  AND (c.issued_qty - c.consumed_qty - c.reserved_qty) &gt;= $qty;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 证件适用性判定：三个时间条件必须同时满足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">certificate_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_certificate c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">holder_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $holder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quota_order_number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ISSUED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIALLY_USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $entry_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_to</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 条件 2/3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $entry_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_period_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tariff_rate_quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $quota)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_period_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tariff_rate_quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quota_order_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $quota)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">issued_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consumed_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserved_qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $qty;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把四个条件（持有人、配额号、日期区间、余额）写成一条查询而不是散落在业务代码里，是让&quot;证件为什么没被接受&quot;可解释的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下单占用-贸易订单与配额的联动\">下单占用：贸易订单与配额的联动</h2><h3 id=\"占用事件与采购订单绑定\">占用事件与采购订单绑定</h3><p>在现货与期货并存的跨境采购中，&quot;下单&quot;与&quot;报关&quot;之间往往隔着数月。若不做下单占用，采购会依据账面余额重复承诺同一份额度。因此 <code>reserved_qty</code> 的写入时机应与采购订单（PO）确认绑定，而不是与报关绑定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"PO 确认事件:&#10;  reserve(cert, qty, po_id):&#10;    if available(cert) &gt;= qty:&#10;        cert.reserved_qty += qty&#10;        write quota_reservation(po_id, cert_id, qty, expires_at = po.expected_ship_date + buffer)&#10;    else:&#10;        mark PO as &#39;QUOTA_UNSECURED&#39;   -- 采购侧需决策是否接受配额外成本&#10;&#10;报关事件:&#10;  consume(cert, entry, qty)          -- 见上节 available 公式&#10;&#10;PO 取消/超期:&#10;  release(cert, po_id)               -- reserved_qty -= qty，额度回池\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>PO 确认事件:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reserve(cert, qty, po_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if available(cert) >= qty:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cert.reserved_qty += qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        write quota_reservation(po_id, cert_id, qty, expires_at = po.expected_ship_date + buffer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mark PO as 'QUOTA_UNSECURED'   -- 采购侧需决策是否接受配额外成本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>报关事件:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  consume(cert, entry, qty)          -- 见上节 available 公式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PO 取消/超期:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  release(cert, po_id)               -- reserved_qty -= qty，额度回池</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>QUOTA_UNSECURED</code> 这个标记至关重要：它把&quot;成本不确定性&quot;显式暴露给采购决策，而不是在报关时才发现税率跳档。这类标记与 <a href=\"../remedy-compliance-procurement/supplier-sourcing-substitution\">供应商/转口采购替代与成本</a> 的成本模拟是同一套数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证件稽核与常见缺陷\">证件稽核与常见缺陷</h2><h3 id=\"三对账与常见缺陷\">三对账与常见缺陷</h3><p>配额证件的稽核通常围绕&quot;三对账&quot;展开：证件签发量与主管部门台账对账、证件消耗量与报关记录对账、额度池余额与已分配+已消耗之和对账。三类常见缺陷：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>修复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超额占用</td>\n<td><code>consumed &gt; issued</code></td>\n<td>缺 CHECK 约束或应用层未校验</td>\n<td>加数据库层不变式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复占用</td>\n<td>同一报关扣两次额度</td>\n<td>缺 (cert, entry) 唯一约束</td>\n<td>加唯一索引 + 幂等写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死额度</td>\n<td>大量已分配从未消耗</td>\n<td>无到期释放任务</td>\n<td>定时任务归还过期额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨期串用</td>\n<td>上期证件用于本期报关</td>\n<td>只校验证件有效期未校验配额期</td>\n<td>双重时间条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归还不及时</td>\n<td>池长期偏小，配额用不满</td>\n<td>释放事件未实现</td>\n<td>显式 release 事件流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;死额度&quot;是最容易被忽视的一类：已签发但未使用的额度若不被及时归还，会使整个配额的实际利用率下降，进而使后续进口商拿不到额度。因此过期释放任务在工程上是必需品，而非优化项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>证件管理把额度生命周期拉长为四态（申请中/已分配/已占用/已释放或过期），不能用一个 <code>balance</code> 数字表达。</li>\n<li>核心设计是 <code>issued_qty / reserved_qty / consumed_qty</code> 三量分离，并用数据库 <code>CHECK</code> 约束把不变式固化。</li>\n<li>可用量 = 签发量 − 已消耗 − 已锁定；没有&quot;锁定&quot;概念的系统必然在下单到报关的窗口里超发。</li>\n<li>证件适用性有四个必要条件：持有人、配额号、日期区间（证件有效期 + 配额期双重）、余额充足。</li>\n<li>过期额度必须由定时任务归还额度池，否则产生&quot;死额度&quot;，降低整体配额利用率。</li>\n<li>下单占用（<code>reserved_qty</code>）应绑定 PO 确认事件，让成本不确定性以 <code>QUOTA_UNSECURED</code> 显式暴露。TRQ 的两档税率计算见 <a href=\"trq-in-out-two-tier-rate\">TRQ 配额内/外两档税率</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用","id":"配额证与许可证件的管理与占用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"证件的数据模型：双量分离","id":"证件的数据模型-双量分离"},{"level":3,"text":"三量分离的数据模型","id":"三量分离的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"可用证件额度","id":"可用证件额度"},{"level":2,"text":"证件与报关的绑定时序","id":"证件与报关的绑定时序"},{"level":3,"text":"三类时间错配与适用性判定","id":"三类时间错配与适用性判定"},{"level":2,"text":"下单占用：贸易订单与配额的联动","id":"下单占用-贸易订单与配额的联动"},{"level":3,"text":"占用事件与采购订单绑定","id":"占用事件与采购订单绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"证件稽核与常见缺陷","id":"证件稽核与常见缺陷"},{"level":3,"text":"三对账与常见缺陷","id":"三对账与常见缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TRQ 配额内/配额外的两档税率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/trq-in-out-two-tier-rate"},"next":{"title":"配额余额查询、申请与下单占用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/quota-balance-allocation-order"}}